  "body": "It seems this isn't actually implemented, though we have an open request to extend it in #1897. And we have https://www.w3.org/Bugs/Public/show_bug.cgi?id=28228 and https://www.w3.org/Bugs/Public/show_bug.cgi?id=28747 proposing to standardize a subset of the `inputmode` functionality by standardizing proprietary attributes that are actually shipping in some implementations and see some usage in the wild.\r\n\r\ncc @TakayoshiKochi @dtapuska @tkent-google",
